cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tcslog-tools: command-line tools for reading tcslog logs"
abstract: >-
  tcslog-tools is two command-line programs that read logs written with
  tcslog, the TCS Onboard Log: tcslog-dump, which walks a whole log and
  prints the records it recovers, saying what was lost where segments are
  missing or damaged, and tcslog-dumphdr, which prints one segment file's
  header. They read any tcslog log, whichever language wrote it.
authors:
  - name: "TCSpecial Team"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vomlehn/tcslog-tools"
keywords:
  - telemetry
  - logging
  - spacecraft
  - command-line tools
